# {{ name }}

An Almasix package. Discoverable via the ``almasix.providers`` entry point.

## Install

```bash
pip install -e .
```

Then either rely on auto-discovery, or list the provider in ``config/app.py``:

```python
"providers": [
    "{{ module }}.provider.{{ class }}ServiceProvider",
],
```

## Publish

```bash
smith vendor:publish --tag={{ module }}-config
```
